  "abstract": "Generalization study per reviewer: remove residual copy (RC) from the Factorized Global MLP + LN backbone and add learnable per-horizon \u03b3[t]. Config: p=32, H=512\u00d72, dr=0.10, Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, curvature \u03bb=1e\u22124, 60\u2011min trials. Tests if \u03b3 helps when RC is absent.",
